1 0 0 1 48 764 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 48 750 Tm (1\) System Architecture) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 736 Tm (Pipeline: Multi-format CAN Parser -> Feature Engineering -> StandardScaler -> IsolationForest) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 722 Tm (anomaly detection -> KMeans clustering -> anomaly intelligence -> LLM explanation -> FastAPI) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 708 Tm (endpoints.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 694 Tm (The service is vehicle-agnostic and does not require DBC decoding.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 680 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 48 666 Tm (2\) Why Isolation Forest) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 652 Tm (Isolation Forest is unsupervised and suitable for mixed, unlabeled CAN telemetry where normal) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 638 Tm (and abnormal boundaries are unknown. It isolates rare behaviors using random partitioning and) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 624 Tm (scales well for high-volume logs.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 610 Tm (Random Forest is supervised; it requires labeled classes and is therefore not a fit for cold-) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 596 Tm (start anomaly detection.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 582 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 48 568 Tm (3\) Feature Engineering) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 554 Tm (Core features: time_diff, message_frequency, window_frequency, byte_mean, byte_max, byte_std.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 540 Tm (Advanced features: rolling_mean_8, rolling_std_8, payload_entropy.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 526 Tm (These features capture timing behavior, bus activity intensity, and payload variability without) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 512 Tm (OEM-specific decoding.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 498 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 48 484 Tm (4\) Improvements Implemented) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 470 Tm (- Parser expanded for candump, ASC Rx/Tx d lines, and generic ID#DATA fallback.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 456 Tm (- Parse quality metrics added \(total/parsed/skipped lines\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 442 Tm (- Time-window frequency and rolling statistics added.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 428 Tm (- Entropy feature added for payload variability.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 414 Tm (- IsolationForest anomaly scoring converted to normalized severity \(0..1\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 400 Tm (- Automatic cluster count selection \(elbow-style\), plus cluster profiles.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 386 Tm (- Model persistence added via joblib save/load.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 372 Tm (- FastAPI hardened with request/response schemas and typed errors.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 358 Tm (- Added /metrics endpoint for uptime, request counts, anomaly totals, and average latency.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 344 Tm (- Added caching for repeated file analysis using SHA256 fingerprints.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 330 Tm (- Added structured anomaly type classification: frequency/timing/data/pattern.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 316 Tm (- LLM prompt upgraded to include severity, type, confidence, and cluster profile.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 302 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 48 288 Tm (5\) Limitations) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 274 Tm (- No DBC decoding by design. This preserves portability but reduces semantic signal naming) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 260 Tm (precision.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 246 Tm (- Statistical clusters are behavioral groups, not guaranteed OEM subsystem labels.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 232 Tm (- LLM explanations depend on API availability and key configuration.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 218 Tm () Tj
